<title>POLAND: Rafako up on plan for strategic investor.</title>
<headline>Rafako up on plan for strategic investor.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish industrial boilermaker Rafako SA surged 9.7 percent to 18.1 zlotys in a 2.7-million-zloty turnover after the firm said on Wednesday it sought a strategic investor, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;It's good news. I'm sure Rafako will extend its gains,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
